        <mxCell id="title" parent="1" style="text;html=1;align=left;verticalAlign=middle;whiteSpace=wrap;fontFamily=Helvetica;" value="&lt;b style=&quot;font-size:22px&quot;&gt;GIÚP VIỆC MVP5 — PHYSICAL DATABASE (SQL Server)&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:12px;color:#555&quot;&gt;20 bảng vật lý · 33 khóa ngoại · triển khai từ Conceptual ERD MVP5 + PRD-MVP5-FINAL (v5.0) · Job_Assignment = Flattened Execution Junction · Worker = Single Table Inheritance&lt;/span&gt;" vertex="1">
          <mxGeometry height="60" width="1500" x="80" y="40" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="notes" parent="1" style="rounded=1;arcSize=3;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacing=12;fontSize=11;fontFamily=Helvetica;fillColor=#FAFAFA;strokeColor=#999999;dashed=1;" value="&lt;b style=&quot;font-size:13px&quot;&gt;LUỒNG NGHIỆP VỤ ↔ BẢNG DỮ LIỆU&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;b&gt;MF1 · Đặt dịch vụ:&lt;/b&gt; CUSTOMER → CUSTOMER_ADDRESS (total_area_m2 = floor_area_m2 × num_floors) → JOB_ORDER [PENDING_PAYMENT] → PAYMENT_TRANSACTION (IPN txn_status = SUCCESS) → JOB_ORDER [PAID → DISPATCHING] → JOB_ASSIGNMENT [ASSIGNED] + BOOKING_SLOT [AVAILABLE → LOCKED]. Economy: bán kính 5 → 7 → 10 km, 30 s/thợ; Premium: SHIFT_ROSTER của Agency. Diện tích &amp;gt; 80 m² → required_workers = 2 (assignment_seq 1, 2).&lt;br&gt;&lt;b&gt;MF2 · Thực thi:&lt;/b&gt; JOB_ASSIGNMENT → CHECK_IN_LOG (distance_m ≤ 100) → JOB_PHOTO BEFORE (vol_score ≥ ngưỡng) → JOB_PHOTO AFTER / REWORK → customer_confirmed_at → [COMPLETED] → TWO_WAY_RATING (≤ 48 h, 1 bản ghi / rater_role).&lt;br&gt;&lt;b&gt;Nhánh ngoại lệ:&lt;/b&gt; INCIDENT_LOG (BR-10, re-dispatch 5 phút, penalty_waived) · CHECK_IN_LOG.customer_absent_at (BR-05, absence_fee_amount = 40 %) · JOB_ORDER_EXTENSION + PAYMENT_TRANSACTION[EXTENSION] (BR-08).&lt;br&gt;&lt;b&gt;MF3 · Tranh chấp:&lt;/b&gt; DISPUTE_TICKET (≤ 24 h sau ca, sla_due_at = +48 h) → ADMIN.resolved_by → fault_party: FREELANCER → trừ PAYOUT_ITEM.penalty_amount · AGENCY → trừ PARTNER_AGENCY.escrow_deposit_balance &amp;amp; sla_score.&lt;br&gt;&lt;b&gt;MF4 · B2B &amp;amp; quyết toán:&lt;/b&gt; SUBSCRIPTION_PACKAGE → PARTNER_SUBSCRIPTION → PAYMENT_TRANSACTION[SUBSCRIPTION]; cuối tháng PAYOUT_BATCH (period_month) → PAYOUT_ITEM (FREELANCER nhận 80 % | AGENCY tổng hợp) ← JOB_ASSIGNMENT.payout_item_id; ADMIN.confirmed_by chốt kỳ." vertex="1">
          <mxGeometry height="200" width="900" x="80" y="1460" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="legend" parent="1" style="rounded=1;arcSize=3;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacing=12;fontSize=11;fontFamily=Helvetica;fillColor=#FAFAFA;strokeColor=#999999;dashed=1;" value="&lt;b style=&quot;font-size:13px&quot;&gt;CHÚ GIẢI &amp;amp; RÀNG BUỘC&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;font color=&quot;#E8231A&quot;&gt;cột (PK)&lt;/font&gt; khóa chính · &lt;font color=&quot;#0000FF&quot;&gt;cột (UQ)&lt;/font&gt; khóa nghiệp vụ duy nhất · cột (FK) khóa ngoại · &lt;b&gt;đậm&lt;/b&gt; = NOT NULL · thường = NULL · &lt;i&gt;nghiêng&lt;/i&gt; = cột kỹ thuật/audit&lt;br&gt;Crow&#39;s foot: ┼┼ bắt buộc 1 · ○┼ 0..1 (FK NULL) · ○&amp;lt; 0..N · ┼&amp;lt; 1..N&lt;br&gt;&lt;b&gt;CHECK&lt;/b&gt; Worker: (worker_type = &#39;FREELANCER&#39; AND agency_id IS NULL) OR (&#39;AGENCY_STAFF&#39; AND agency_id IS NOT NULL)&lt;br&gt;&lt;b&gt;CHECK&lt;/b&gt; Payment_Transaction: đúng 1 trong (order_id, extension_id, subscription_id) khác NULL theo purpose&lt;br&gt;&lt;b&gt;CHECK&lt;/b&gt; Payout_Item: payee_type = FREELANCER ⇒ worker_id; AGENCY ⇒ agency_id&lt;br&gt;&lt;b&gt;UNIQUE&lt;/b&gt; Booking_Slot(worker_id, slot_date, shift_code) · Two_Way_Rating(assignment_id, rater_role) · Job_Assignment(slot_id) WHERE assignment_status NOT IN (&#39;CANCELLED&#39;,&#39;REASSIGNED&#39;)&lt;br&gt;&lt;b&gt;INDEX&lt;/b&gt; Job_Assignment(worker_id), (agency_id), (order_id), (customer_id) — truy vấn 0-JOIN theo PRD §5.2" vertex="1">
          <mxGeometry height="170" width="800" x="2250" y="1700" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
